Subject: Pair search results — what the list must return
Message-ID: <pair-0021@sara.it>

One correction to the draft. The draft said the search list returns only the **title** of each item.
After going through the screens with Davide (frontend), that's not enough.

The **search result list** must return, for each item:
- the **title**,
- the associated **url** when there is one,
- plus the **identifier** and the **type**, so the UI can open the right detail screen.

Very important, and this is a hard rule: **no secrets in the search results.** Passwords, card
numbers, CVVs, PINs — none of the sensitive values may appear in the search list. Those are only
ever returned by the **detail** call. The list is just enough to show a row and navigate.

Giorgia
